DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssiillii driver provides support for SATA controllers using the Silicon
     Image 3124/3132/3531 SATALink chipsets.

     Although ssiillii controllers are actual ATA controllers, the driver emulates
     SCSI via a translation layer.

